and refusal rules, and absorbing Stop of
[Native Leaf Depth Contact, Assumptions 1.2 and Definition 1.3](RECURSIVE_RELATIONAL_OBSERVATION_NATIVE_LEAF_DEPTH_CONTACT.md),
